<title>POLAND: GPRD to list 1.27 mln more shares Jun 30.</title>
<headline>GPRD to list 1.27 mln more shares Jun 30.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw stock exchange said on Friday it would start trading an additional 1,274,000 shares of Polish road construction company Gdanskie Przedsiebiorstwo Robot Budowlanych SA (GPRD) on June 30.</p>
<p>&quot;GPRD's additional shares, 185,000 series B and 1,089,000 series C, enter trade on June 30,&quot; the bourse's president Wieslaw Rozlucki said.</p>
<p>GPRD now has 2,248,700 shares listed on the bourse.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
